<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! We found out\nsomethin’ about the Egg!\rMy assistant at the Trap House\nin Violet City.\fGo holla at him.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo! Ayo!\nYou a Hustler?\rYou beat the Block Boss yet? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayyyy!\nThat’s what’s UP!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Nah? Then you need school, fam!\fFollow me!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This my school. I run it.\nNobody else wanted to.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Word is Ghost-type homies been\nhauntin’ Sprout Tower.\rNormal-type moves go straight\nthrough ’em. Spooky, bro.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, you a Hustler?\rIf you beat the Block Boss here,\nyou ready for the big time!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Falkner, the Violet City Block Boss,\nis a real one!\rHe took over his pops’ block and\nkept it runnin’ clean.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You can’t have your homie out\nwalkin’ with you everywhere.\rBuildings, caves, spots where\nit’s mad crowded...\rJust throw it back in a\nHood Ball. Easy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Violet City\nThe City of Old Heads and Incense</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Violet City Block\nBoss: Falkner\fBird Man of Violet. Feeds Pigeons.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sprout Tower\rCome Get Humbled by Some\nOld Heads in Robes.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hood School\rEarl Teach You Everything.\nNo Refunds.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hold up, hold up...\nThat Egg is...!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I see...\nSo Mr. Pokémon passed it to\fProfessor Elm, then Elm passed\fit to you.\rOkay, okay. I see the chain\nof custody...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That Egg is important, fr.\nDon’t drop it. Don’t sell it.\rWe clear?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m countin’ on you.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Shards for Berries!\nShards for Berries!\rYeah, yeah!\nI flip Shards into Berries.\rBring me Shards and I’ll\nbless you with three Berries.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Shards for Berries!\nShards for Berries!\rYeah, yeah!\nI flip Shards into Berries.\rBring me Shards and I’ll\nbless you with three Berries.\rWhich Shard you tradin’\nfor Berries? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Got more Shards to flip\nfor Berries? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bet, bet!\nCome back when you\fchange your mind.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Berry set A for the\nRed Shard. Deal.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Berry set B for the\nBlue Shard. Deal.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Berry set C for the\nYellow Shard. Deal.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Berry set D for the\nGreen Shard. Deal.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You already got a lot of\nBerries from this set.\rCome back when you run out.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We keep it traditional round here.\nEven the Corner Store and Trap\fHouse painted all dull to\fblend in. Real bougie.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know the Pokégear let you put\nmarks and memos on the Map?\rI want one so bad, but my mama\nsay I’ll just lose it.</language>
	</row>
</body>
